title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":16,"dc":24},"tradition":{"value":"primal"},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":1},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null}},"_id":"Ai4mhQRTcfITNiWn","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/dispel-magic.webp","name":"Dispel Magic (Primal Only)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You unravel the magic behind a spell or effect. Attempt a counteract check against the target. If you successfully counteract a magic item, the item becomes a mundane item of its type for 10 minutes. This doesn't change the item's non-magical properties. If the target is an artifact or similar item, you automatically fail.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"dispel-magic","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 spell effect or unattended magic item"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"Ai4mhQRTcfITNiWn","heightenedLevel":4,"uses":{"max":3,"value":3}},"counteraction":true},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.9HpwDN4MYQJnW0LG","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"Tc3dB8QZeZARZ1oo"},{"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/detect-magic.webp","name":"Detect Magic (Constant, Primal Only)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies. You detect illusion magic only if that magic's effect has a lower rank than the rank of your <em>detect magic</em> spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.equipment.Item.bikFUFRLwfdvX2x2]{Invisibility Potion}) typically are detected normally.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You learn the rank or level of the most powerful magical effect the spell detects, as determined by the GM.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> As 3rd rank, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-rank magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"detect-magic","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","detection","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"type":"emanation","value":30},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"Ai4mhQRTcfITNiWn"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.gpzpAAAJ1Lza2JVl","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"pbvHiv5pz6fQp0AF"},{"type":"action","name":"Rotten Influence","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>15 feet. A creature who enters or begins its turn in the aura takes @Damage[1d8[void]] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:21|basic] save). Plant creatures take a –2 circumstance penalty to this saving throw. All non-creature plants in the area that are Small or smaller and are not magical wither, eliminating any difficult terrain, cover, or concealment they provided.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":15,"traits":["death","primal","void"],"effects":[{"uuid":"Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.sf2e-effects.Item.dJZrC8CkTfeox8B9","includesSelf":false,"predicate":["target:trait:plant"]}]}],"slug":"rotten-influence","traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","death","primal","void"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"AG7bYRcl4KvD3wws","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.348","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.3"}},{"type":"action","name":"Fungal Burst","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 15 feet hits the rotwood with an unarmed or melee weapon Strike</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Fungi embedded in the rotwood's bark discharge a burst of spores toward the creature. Each creature in a @Template[type:cone|distance:15] must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:22] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} for 1 round.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"y3hVCgZTbGZJarNE","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Rotting Bough","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["reach-15"]},"damageRolls":{"Vtw4yTPDZSrqdeEe":{"damage":"2d8+8","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":18},"attackEffects":{"value":["withering-touch"]}},"_id":"PpyhHlG8MSi3vfXh","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Rock","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"damageRolls":{"QZyqlJh7Tv55ueAn":{"damage":"1d10+8","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":18},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"CDjaMfOYIRUG2ZqI","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Withering Touch","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The rotwood's last action was a successful rotting bough Strike</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The rotwood channels corruption into the target of their Strike, dealing @Damage[3d8[void]] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:22|basic] save).</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} for 1 minute.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage and is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2} for 1 minute.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["primal","void"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"AxLG8X1PF6Dw1Rkf","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Spew Insects","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The rotwood vomits forth a great swarm of termites and mosquitoes that bite and stinging all in their wake, dealing @Damage[7d6[piercing]|options:area-damage] damage in a @Template[type:cone|distance:30] (@Check[reflex|dc:25|basic] save). Any creature that fails its save is also @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. The rotwood can't use Spew Insects again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Spew Insects]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"u74YoLWF4phpo8tc","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Throw Rock","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ThrowRock]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"throw-rock","_migration":{"v